    </task>
    <task >
        <statement>
            <p>
                <m>ln(e)</m>
            </p>
        </statement>
    </task>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<introduction>
<p>
    The most important phrase in learning logs is _______ are _________________.
</p>
<p>
    Keeping this in mind, convert these logs and exponentials.
</p>
</introduction>
<task workspace="0.01in">
<statement>
    <p>
        <m>14^2=x</m>  as a log:
    </p>
</statement>
</task>
<task workspace="0.01in">
<statement>
    <p>
        <m>e^{0.7x}=4.05</m> as a natural log:
    </p>
</statement>
</task>
<task workspace="0.01in">
<statement>
    <p>
        <m>log_{0.5}(25)=x</m> as an exponential:
    </p>
</statement>
</task>
<task workspace="0.01in">
<statement>
    <p>
        <m>ln(e^x)=-3</m> as an exponential:
    </p>
</statement>
</task>
</exercise>
</page>
</worksheet>